  speakerName: Rafaela
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4f10aa612ccd51d449f87e131a87002e, type: 3}
  portugueseText: "O que era aquilo? Quando aquele cara sumiu, eu senti que n\xE3o
    tinha mais controle da minha mente, que eu enxerguei o mundo pelos olhos de outra
    pessoa."
  englishText: What was that? When that guy disapeard, I felt like I no longer had
    control of my mind, that I was seeing the world through someone else's eyes.
